        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs(HTTP): X-Content-Type-Options — mention impact on document sniffing]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41776</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41776"/>
        <updated>2025-11-02T21:43:47.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/160616048?u=c67d934d3d5438fa90d22a59e3c49636cd31c75c&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">What</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Clarify that <code class="notranslate">X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff</code> also affects document navigations:<br>
user agents should avoid sniffing and treating content as HTML when the <code class="notranslate">Content-Type</code> is incorrect or missing.</li>
<li>Add a short subsection “Effect on HTML document sniffing” with references.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Why</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>The current page focuses on scripts and styles; this update reflects the MIME sniffing algorithm behavior for documents as discussed in WHATWG.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">How to verify</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Run <code class="notranslate">yarn start</code> and preview /en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/X-Content-Type-Options.</li>
<li>Confirm the new subsection is rendered and links work.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">References</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>WHATWG MIME Sniffing algorithm: <a href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type-sniffing-algorithm" rel="nofollow">https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type-sniffing-algorithm</a></li>
<li>Discussion: <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="424897683" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/98" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/98/hovercard" href="https://github.com/whatwg/mimesniff/issues/98">whatwg/mimesniff#98</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #41745.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3570561352" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41745" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/41745/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41745">#41745</a></p>]]></content>
